      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778167191961,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Large Language Models (LLMs) have unlocked powerful new capabilities in software, but harnessing them in production systems (LLMOps) requires more than just plugging in an API.\n\nTwo critical disciplines have emerged in recent years:\n\n- Prompt engineering\n- Context engineering",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Large Language Models (LLMs) have unlocked powerful new capabilities in software, but harnessing them in production systems (LLMOps) requires more than just plugging in an API.\n\nTwo critical disciplines have emerged in recent years:\n\n- Prompt engineering\n- Context engineering",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
