    {
      "id": "RI6kkqF3d7wrnqPr4Qe1Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15385.3473520045,
      "y": 31925.24640141066,
      "width": 1203.6881103515625,
      "height": 264.60937499999994,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c07S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 499932591,
      "version": 401,
      "versionNonce": 1923954031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778167175776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The key takeaway is that prompt engineering gives us multiple levers: \nwe can shape who the model pretends to be (system/role), what it \nshould consider (context/examples), how to respond (format/style),\n and exactly what question to answer (user query).\n\n",
      "fontSize": 35.28124999999999,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The key takeaway is that prompt engineering gives us multiple levers: \nwe can shape who the model pretends to be (system/role), what it \nshould consider (context/examples), how to respond (format/style),\n and exactly what question to answer (user query).\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_W2UGn-_GibcIFdMjp73i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15445.315747237655,
      "y": 32184.019690137466,
      "width": 769.0322875976562,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c07T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1748992161,
      "version": 421,
      "versionNonce": 694333327,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778167175776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Effective prompt development means pulling \nthe right combination of these levers \nfor the task at hand.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Effective prompt development means pulling \nthe right combination of these levers \nfor the task at hand.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
