      "text": "Note that in few shot prompting, ordering\ncan also matter. Sometimes models exhibit\nrecency bias to the last example, so you\nmight need to order by complexity or use\nrandomization during development.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note that in few shot prompting, ordering can also matter. Sometimes models exhibit recency bias to the last example, so you might need to order by complexity or use randomization during development.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
